Z||000006||mrfiero||08-26-2000||11:34 AM||||I just installed one of Rodneys new sub speakers into my GT.  It is actually smaller(!?) than the stock speaker, so installation isn't as easy as bolt it in.  Still, it only took about 45 minutes to pull the box, do the mods and re-install the box.  The result?  I now have a subwoofer system again!  It sounds just as good, if not better, than the factory speaker.  I highly recommend Rodney's speaker to anyone who needs it.       ||||reg||10
